  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4cc8f63640c17e5af9cdfc3b1e0aec219549b666eec21d379b8feb7bd6c52eb4.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n[78 -{5 + 3 of (25 – 2 × 10)}] ÷ 29\n\n⇒ [78 - {5 + 3 of (25 – 20)}] ÷ 29\n\n⇒ [78 - {5 + 3 of 5}] ÷ 29\n\n⇒ [78 - {5 + 15}] ÷ 29\n\n⇒ [78 - 20] ÷ 29\n\n⇒ 58 ÷ 29 \n\n⇒ 2\n\n**∴ The value is 2.**",
